{"id":"vod_sn_37872","vodId":"37872","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"赤之约束","name_cn":"赤之约束","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a9d87408c00017cdc988ac1cf5223d99.jpg"},"summary":"在少年支仓孝平（小野大辅 配音）的记忆中，自己好像一直都在转学中，这样的遭遇使得孝平很难拥有一段长久且稳定的友谊。这一次，孝平转入了修智馆学院，这所全日制的寄宿学校为孝平晦暗的心情带来了新的希望，孝平决定，一定要在这所学校里交到要好的朋友。 很快的，热情善良的孝平身边就聚集了一群朋友们。阳光健气的千堂瑛里华（神田理江 配音），娇小害羞的东仪白（峰岸由里香 配音），沉默冷静的红瀬桐叶（鸣海绘里香 配音），这些可爱女孩子们的存在丰富了孝平的课余生活，但在交往的同时，孝平也在不经意间发现了她们的秘密，这也为他进入学生会这“狼窝”奠定了基础。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eBPrR4je6q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hAYEagW0541/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Hq9ffnkXiq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8KHdvC8mSc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zATyU2pEHM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CHQeVV7jSU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d1YgeWW6i21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JiBZTL0tYB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VWKFL3BfDG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8A4G5VNMYT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jGbNAJ1HRN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jbV6CC4ECr1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:05.598Z"}